      "chord_quality": "sus4",
      "function_role": "preferred-label-over-add2-c2",
      "narrative": "Chapter 3 (p. 4) and Chapter 2 (p. 4) explicitly prescribe sus4 labeling over shorter notations such as C2 or add-2 on grounds of musician legibility. The author states 'I will grant you that C2 is shorter, but' and recommends 'G [sus4]' as the suitable name. This prescription extends to all inversions of both 3-part and 4-part fourth-based structures.",
