      "function_role": "m-lode-taxonomy-member",
      "narrative": "Chapter 3 (p. 7) prescribes '7th (no 5th)' as a distinct 3-part chord type within the expanded M-Lode. Arises directly from the voice-omission derivation taught in Chapter 4 (p. 9): removing a single voice from a 4-part 7th chord.",
