      "function_role": "m-lode-taxonomy-member",
      "narrative": "Chapter 3 (p. 7) prescribes '3-part Spread Clusters' as the third new 3-part chord type completing the expanded M-Lode. Must be cataloged as a distinct 3-part chord family alongside 7th (no 3rd) and 7th (no 5th).",
