      "chord_quality": "3-part",
      "function_role": "passing-tone-embellishment-in-c-major",
      "narrative": "Chapter 5 (p. 15) prescribes that passing-tone and melodic-embellishment exercises on 3-part voicings are learned first in C Major (no accidentals): 'All of the material that follows in this next section will be presented in C Major (no accidentals).' The student is then expected to transpose independently to other 7-note scales.",
